error[PA017]: a `..` parameter must be the last one
 --> bad-rest-param.lm:4:23
  |
4 | fn misplaced(..first, second) { first }
  |                       ^^^^^^ nothing can follow it
  |
  = note: it takes every remaining argument, so there are none left

error[PA017]: `..parts` cannot have a default value
 --> bad-rest-param.lm:6:14
  |
6 | fn defaulted(..parts = 1) { parts }
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^ a `..` parameter is always given a list, possibly empty
  |
  = note: drop the `= ...`; it can never be reached
